  "note": "Two barre shapes carry the song: F on the sixth string and Bb on the fifth. The verse stays on F for three bars and on Bb for three, so keep the eighth-note strum going and save your attention for the single bar of C. The chorus opens out to Dm, Bb and two bars of C. The lead guitar parts are left out.",
